{"id":"gewohnt","lemma":"gewohnt","pos":"adj","rank":1854,"glosses":["usual, customary, familiar","used to, wont, familiar"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/74/De-at-gewohnt.ogg/De-at-gewohnt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Haben sie hier gewohnt?","en":"Did they live here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394932","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe bei meinem Onkel gewohnt.","en":"I stayed with my uncle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755914","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"at / with"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"uncle"},null]},{"text":"Hast du früher hier gewohnt?","en":"Did you live here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392323","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"formerly, in the past"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"Habt ihr hier lange gewohnt?","en":"Did you live here long?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"long, for a long time"},null]},{"text":"Er ist die Arbeit gewohnt.","en":"He is used to the work.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"toil"},null]}]}